11
01:07:13,333 --> 01:07:19,333
A remake of the 2022 Danish-Dutch film of the same name, the film stars James McAvoy,
Mackenzie Davis, Aisling Franciosi, Alix West Lefler, Dan Hough, and Scoot McNairy.

12
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
Its plot follows an American family who are invited to stay at a remote farmhouse of a British couple for
the weekend: the hosts soon test the limits of their guests as the situation escalates.

13
01:19:26,666 --> 01:19:32,666
Jason Blum serves as a producer through his Blumhouse Productions banner.

14
01:25:33,333 --> 01:25:39,333
Speak No Evil premiered at the DGA Theater in New York City on September 9, 2024, and
was released in the United States by Universal Pictures on September 13.

15
01:31:40,000 --> 01:31:46,000
The film received positive reviews from critics and grossed $77
million worldwide with a budget of $15 million.

16
01:37:46,666 --> 01:37:52,666
The film explores themes of husband wife relationship,
manipulation, remake, hopeless, weekend getaway.

17
01:43:53,333 --> 01:43:59,333
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
